<title>JAPAN: Fujicco - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujicco - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.22		vs	   17.62</p>
<p> Operating	    1.51		vs	    1.22</p>
<p> Current		1.75		vs	    1.41</p>
<p> Net		  923 million	 vs	  708 million</p>
<p> EPS		   39.65 yen	  vs	   30.39 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     23 million	  vs	  23 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujicco Co Ltd makes and markets cooked beans and soy-cooked foods.</p>
</text>
